  "notes": "SessionSifu 3.5.8 adds compositor-safe multi-workspace Recall previews using a bounded memory cache of previously visible windows, with honest capture timestamps and no forced workspace switching. It also saves the total workspace count and prevents overlapping apps from being captured as another window."
